      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FROSTY DROP (1) led from a couple of spots wider and fought on well for second last start at Horsham. Came from this barrier when edged out narrowly at Melton prior. Her hoof is on the till. Can break through here. BLACKINDEED (3) finished in the placings two runs back and again performed admirably last start, making up plenty of ground but finding a couple better at Melton. Should enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position and will be approaching peak fitness now. RAKAROMPA NZ (4) made an encouraging return when he came from the back row and finished runner-up last time out. Fitter and owns a good record here. TRYX VIXEN (5) continued her consistent form with a respectable third at her most recent appearance at Echuca and came from the back row to score at Shepparton prior. Respect.",
